⚠️ Error / Problem Faced

The interface depends on JavaScript callbacks such as:

notebook.select_image
notebook.select_video

Colab widget and JavaScript behavior can fail if callbacks are not registered correctly or if the notebook has not completely initialized.

✅ Resolution

The callback registration and JavaScript selection mechanism were reviewed.

The default image and video were explicitly selected using:

select_image('00')
select_video('0')

The project registers the corresponding callbacks for selecting images and videos.

